cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt Quant Notebook, please cite it as below."
title: "Quant Notebook: From Engineer to Quant"
abstract: >-
  A free, open, in-depth course that takes software, data and AI engineers to professional quant
  level: markets, mathematics, financial data engineering, research discipline, factor investing,
  strategy families, portfolio construction and risk, derivatives, rates, machine learning,
  alternative data, market microstructure and production trading systems — 100 illustrated
  sessions with companion Python labs.
type: software
authors:
